LRC ADD/MULT GAUGE STACK - S513
============================================================================
Denominator vertices: 10 12 14 15 16 18 20 21 22 24 26 27 28 30
Tie Hamiltonian path: increasing denominator order.
Even additive fiber: Goldbach pairs N=p+q.
Odd additive fiber: Levy/Lemoine pairs N=p+2q.
Multiplicative grid: N = 2^h * odd_core; horizontal odd_core -> odd_core+2, vertical h -> h+1.
Product-sum bridge: P-S=D and D ones repair the equation; two-factor layer is (a-1)(b-1)=N-1.
A000568 bridge: unlabelled tournament Burnside terms survive on odd cycle partitions; here we track odd partition survival as a coarse shadow.

